'''Le'boin''' (パオン, ''Paon'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]], [[Legend Stages]] and the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

