==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Le'boin
|Lord Enma
|This [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy first seen in [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]] is a combination of [[Doge]] and Le'boin.
|Le'noir
|A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of Le'boin. Has far higher health and damage, and slightly more range.
|Le'mammoth
|An event variant of Le'boin introduced in the [[Cats in the Snow]] event, with the ability to create [[Wave Attack]]s. Also appears in [[Zero Legends]].
|Le'Solar
|A [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of Le'boin. She has a 40,000 HP [[Barrier]] as well as increased health, damage and attack speed.
|Heavenly Le'saint
|An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of Lord Enma. He has a faster attack rate and gets stronger at 50% HP, but has significantly shorter range.
|Le'Grim
|A [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossal]] variant of Le'noir that appears in the [[Le'Grim Strikes]] gauntlet. He has higher range and the ability to slow cats for 6.67 seconds. Though weak initially, he receives insane strength magnifications in the later stages of Le'Grim Strikes.
|Le'Behemoth
|An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of Le'Boin with blue skin, yellow eyes, black tusks, and a pentagram on his forehead. This variant is protected by a durable [[Shield]] and has only 380 range, but pushes more easily with an [[Omni Strike]] that reaches up to 410.
|Elephantidae Papaou
|A [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of Le'Boin. Much stronger in health, damage and attack rate, has slightly longer range, and is immune to to all negative effects. However, he has half the movement speed and double the backswing of the original.
|Le'Prude
|A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of Le'boin from [[Zero Legends]]. It's more resilient, attacks much faster and has a lower range, but compensates with an Omni Strike that reaches up to 400 range and creates an [[Explosion]] with every attack.
}}

